    await test('旧日真实地下城显示名key能关联助战及自己并允许缓存站位更新', `fixture.hermitBattle();const state=await h.setupBattleLineup('order','旧日',h.dungeonPolicy());return JSON.stringify(state.allies_order)==='[3,1,2]'&&fixture.calls.filter(r=>r.path.endsWith('/swap')).length===2&&h.runtime.logs.some(l=>l.message.includes('2号位 阿祇sp (@Guqii0812)'))`);
